  "description": "Short Term rental available from 1st October 2026 to end June 2027.\n\nThis bungalow comes to the market in pristine condition:\n\nThe kitchen is fully equipped with all white electrical goods and a glass conservatory attached.\n\nThe living room has a suite of furniture with a wood burning stove in place,and oil central heating throughout.\n\nThe property features 2 double rooms with en-suites and a bathroom which has a bath tub.\n\nIts located along the Ballyharty Road,\nKilmore area, 25 mins drive to Wexford.. approx 8 min drive to Kilmore Quay fishing village.\n\nWoodlawn is closely located to a local shop in Kilmore village and Centra supermarket in Bridgetown.\n\nNon smoking and no pets allowed.\n\nPlease email to enquire.",
